<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5581/5599.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5581/5599.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5581/5599 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Friday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Saturday will be 5590.</p>
<p>On Thursday the bid/offer rates were 5573/5597, with the official dollar rate 5585 from Friday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
